 "remarks": "***Limited time special! *1/2 month FREE for a 12-13 month lease or 1 month FREE for an 18-month lease for a November 15th (or sooner) start date. *1/2 month security deposit if all applicants have 700+ credit score & qualify financially. Does not apply if a co-signer is needed. *1 parking space is free, second parking space is $75/month***. Storage fees are $50 for the smaller units, $75 for the larger ones. Under new ownership and management! Welcome to Daycroft Apartments - a pet friendly, charming garden-style community ideally located in Stamford's sought-after East Side neighborhood. This beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit offers spacious, light-filled living with modern updates and classic appeal with a generously sized living room, kitchen with a door leading out to your outdoor space, perfect for home cooking or entertaining. This unit blends comfort and functionality, boasting hardwood floors and ample closet space throughout. Community amenities include a playground, BBQs, on-site laundry and peaceful courtyard settings. Conveniently located just minutes from Cove Island Park, Chelsea Piers, shopping, dining, and I-95 for a quick commute. Heat, hot & cold water, and trash collection are included in the rent.",
